  {
    "uid": "C0767",
    "text": "Adam is the first human in the biblical story. Augustine says Adam's disobedience leaves later humans needing forgiveness even before choosing a wrong act. For him, an infant's illness does not show that the child has behaved badly.",
    "occurrences": [
