  },
  {
    "uid": "C1121",
    "text": "Calvin's writings from 1543\u20131559 raise objections about prayer, images and relics. Compare asking a living friend to pray, asking a departed saint and honouring a religious picture or relic. Calvin objects to particular practices and claims; the cases must be considered separately.",
    "occurrences": [
