    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "C1124",
    "text": "The next day, we open the later replies at a cleared desk. Trent's replies disagree with Calvin about saints, images and relics. A new record also helps investigate the bone fragment. Decide which identity question it helps and which religious disagreements it leaves unchanged.",
