  {
    "uid": "C1129",
    "text": "Eating and enjoying comfort can be good. Taking the meal a neighbour needs is wrong because it puts personal comfort above what the neighbour is owed. The fault is in the choice, not in food itself.",
    "occurrences": [
      {
        "row": 4739,
        "world": "divinity-final-reading-scenes-v7",
